<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Paws & Hearts - Discover Your New Best Friend</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #6a5acd;  /* Changed from red to slate blue */
            --secondary: #48d1cc;  /* Changed teal to medium turquoise */
            --light: #f8f8ff;  /* Changed to ghost white */
            --dark: #2f4f4f;  /* Changed to dark slate gray */
            --accent: #ffa500;  /* Changed to orange */
        }
        
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Arial', Helvetica, sans-serif;  /* Changed font stack */
        }
        
        body {
            background-color: var(--light);
            color: var(--dark);
            line-height: 1.7;  /* Increased line height */
        }
        
        header {
            background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--primary), var(--accent));  /* Changed gradient direction */
            color: white;
            padding: 3rem 0;  /* Increased padding */
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 5px solid var(--secondary);  /* Added border */
        }
        
        .logo {
            font-size: 3.5rem;  /* Increased size */
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);  /* Added text shadow */
        }
        
        .tagline {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 300;  /* Changed to lighter weight */
            letter-spacing: 1px;  /* Added letter spacing */
        }
        
        nav {
            background-color: var(--dark);
            padding: 1.2rem;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }
        
        nav ul {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;  /* Changed from center to space-around */
            list-style: none;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        
        nav li {
            margin: 0 1rem;
        }
        
        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        
        nav a:hover {
            color: var(--accent);
            background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
        }
        
        .hero {
            background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544568100-847a948585b9');  /* Changed hero image */
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            height: 70vh;  /* Increased height */
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .hero::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.6));  /* Changed overlay */
        }
        
        .hero-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            max-width: 800px;
            padding: 3rem;  /* Increased padding */
        }
        
        .hero h2 {
            font-size: 3rem;  /* Increased size */
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }
        
        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;  /* Increased padding */
            border-radius: 8px;  /* Changed from pill shape */
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            border: 2px solid transparent;
        }
        
        .btn:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);  /* Changed from translateY */
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            background-color: transparent;
            border-color: white;
        }
        
        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 4rem 0;  /* Increased margin */
            font-size: 2.5rem;  /* Increased size */
            color: var(--primary);  /* Changed color */
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .section-title::after {
            content: '';
            display: block;
            width: 100px;
            height: 4px;
            background-color: var(--accent);
            margin: 1rem auto;
        }
        
        .pets-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr));  /* Slightly larger cards */
            gap: 2.5rem;  /* Increased gap */
            padding: 0 3rem;  /* Increased padding */
            margin-bottom: 5rem;
        }
        
        .pet-card {
            background-color: white;
            border-radius: 15px;  /* Increased border radius */
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);  /* Increased shadow */
            transition: all 0.3s;
            border: 1px solid #eee;
        }
        
        .pet-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px) scale(1.02);  /* Added scale effect */
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        }
        
        .pet-image {
            height: 280px;  /* Increased height */
            width: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-bottom: 5px solid var(--secondary);  /* Added border */
        }
        
        .pet-info {
            padding: 2rem;  /* Increased padding */
        }
        
        .pet-name {
            font-size: 1.6rem;  /* Increased size */
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--primary);
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        
        .pet-breed {
            color: var(--dark);
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }
        
        .pet-age {
            color: #777;
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
            font-style: italic;
        }
        
        .pet-description {
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
        
        .adopt-btn {
            background-color: var(--secondary);
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1rem;  /* Increased padding */
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }
        
        .about {
            padding: 5rem 2rem;  /* Increased padding */
            background-color: var(--primary);  /* Changed from secondary */
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            clip-path: polygon(0 10%, 100% 0, 100% 90%, 0 100%);  /* Added angled edges */
        }
        
        .about-content {
            max-width: 900px;  /* Increased max width */
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        
        .about-content p {
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.9;
        }
        
        footer {
            background-color: var(--dark);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 3rem;  /* Increased padding */
            margin-top: 4rem;
        }
        
        footer h3 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        
        footer p {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        
        .social-icons {
            margin: 2rem 0;
        }
        
        .social-icons a {
            color: white;
            margin: 0 1rem;  /* Increased margin */
            font-size: 2rem;  /* Increased size */
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }
        
        .social-icons a:hover {
            color: var(--accent);
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            nav ul {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
            }
            
            nav li {
                margin: 0.8rem 0;
            }
            
            .hero h2 {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }
            
            .pets-container {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                padding: 0 1.5rem;
            }
            
            .about {
                clip-path: none;
                padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="logo">Paws & Hearts</div>
        <div class="tagline">Connecting loving homes with furry friends</div>
    </header>
    
    <nav>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="#pets">Our Pets</a></li>
            <li><a href="#about">Our Mission</a></li>
            <li><a href="#adopt">How to Adopt</a></li>
            <li><a href="#contact">Get in Touch</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>
    
    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <h2>Your New Best Friend Awaits</h2>
            <p>Discover the joy of pet adoption and give a deserving animal the loving home they've been waiting for.</p>
            <a href="#pets" class="btn">View Adoptable Pets</a>
        </div>
    </section>
    
    <h2 class="section-title" id="pets">Meet Our Furry Friends</h2>
    
    <div class="pets-container">
        <div class="pet-card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1601758003122-53c40e686a19" alt="Golden Retriever" class="pet-image">
            <div class="pet-info">
                <h3 class="pet-name">Buddy</h3>
                <p class="pet-breed">Golden Retriever</p>
                <p class="pet-age">3 years old</p>
                <p class="pet-description">Buddy is a gentle soul who loves belly rubs and playing in the park. He's great with kids and other dogs.</p>
                <a href="#" class="btn adopt-btn">Adopt Buddy</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="pet-card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511044568932-338cba0ad803" alt="Siamese Cat" class="pet-image">
            <div class="pet-info">
                <h3 class="pet-name">Misty</h3>
                <p class="pet-breed">Siamese Cat</p>
                <p class="pet-age">2 years old</p>
                <p class="pet-description">Misty is a talkative and affectionate companion who will follow you everywhere and keep you entertained.</p>
                <a href="#" class="btn adopt-btn">Adopt Misty</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="pet-card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559715541-5daf8a0296d0" alt="Husky Puppy" class="pet-image">
            <div class="pet-info">
                <h3 class="pet-name">Koda</h3>
                <p class="pet-breed">Siberian Husky</p>
                <p class="pet-age">8 months old</p>
                <p class="pet-description">Koda is an energetic puppy with stunning blue eyes who loves adventure and learning new tricks.</p>
                <a href="#" class="btn adopt-btn">Adopt Koda</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="pet-card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1585110396000-c9ffd4e4b308" alt="Guinea Pig" class="pet-image">
            <div class="pet-info">
                <h3 class="pet-name">Pepper</h3>
                <p class="pet-breed">Abyssinian Guinea Pig</p>
                <p class="pet-age">1 year old</p>
                <p class="pet-description">Pepper is a charming little guy with a big personality who loves fresh veggies and cozy hideouts.</p>
                <a href="#" class="btn adopt-btn">Adopt Pepper</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <section class="about" id="about">
        <div class="about-content">
            <h2 class="section-title">Our Mission</h2>
            <p>Since 2018, Paws & Hearts has been dedicated to rescuing animals from shelters and finding them permanent, loving homes. We're more than just an adoption center - we're a community of animal lovers committed to making a difference.</p>
            <p>Our comprehensive approach includes medical care, behavioral training, and post-adoption support to ensure successful matches that last a lifetime. We believe adoption should be a joyful and supported experience for both pets and people.</p>
            <a href="#" class="btn">Our Story</a>
        </div>
    </section>
    
    <footer id="contact">
        <h3>Paws & Hearts Adoption Center</h3>
        <p>456 Animal Rescue Road, Petville, USA</p>
        <p>Phone: (555) 987-6543</p>
        <p>Email: info@pawsandhearts.org</p>
        
        <div class="social-icons">
            <a href="#"><i class="fab fa-facebook"></i></a>
            <a href="#"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i></a>
            <a href="#"><i class="fab fa-twitter"></i></a>
            <a href="#"><i class="fab fa-youtube"></i></a>
        </div>
        
        <p>&copy; 2023 Paws & Hearts. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>
    
    <!-- Font Awesome for icons -->
    <script src="https://kit.fontawesome.com/a076d05399.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
</body>
</html>
